  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Measures Cooperation Facility for Timor-Leste &#xbf; Strategic Communication</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action is linked to the Support measures and Cooperation facility objectives of the MIPs. This particular Support Measures and Cooperation Facility for Timor-Leste provides the European Union Delegation the resources needed to implement a Strategic Communication Plan for the actions implemented with the MIP 2021-2027 until the midterm review.The overall objective of the action is to increase public awareness and understanding of the European Union in Timor-Leste and its role in the country.The specific objective of the action is to support a strategic and inclusive communication plan to promote the interventions supported by the European Union in Timor-Leste and demonstrate their impact in the beneficiaries and in the country&#xbf;s development.</narrative>
  </description>
